    "threat_radius": 2,
    "text": "Passive, one charge per turn, spent on the first of: Trap — your move over a building or a trap does not trigger it (a laid trap, a building's hidden trap or a dungeon's), the trap stays where it is; or Threat — you move into an enemy's threat area (2 hexes) unseen, that monster (or enemy) does not wake or chase you for the rest of the turn. A step that would need both dodges the trap.",
